@startuml SWA-PH1_sequence-ignition-override
title Phase 1 오버라이드 시나리오 — ignition FALSE, Driver_Command 무시 (SWR-020 > SWR-002/004 우선순위)

participant "ARC-102\nVehicleSnapshotTestAdapter" as A102
participant "ARC-001\nEvaluationCycleFacade" as A001
participant "ARC-004\nCommandDispatcher" as A004
participant "ARC-002\nPolicyChainExecutor" as A002
participant "ARC-007\nIgnitionOverridePolicy" as A007
participant "ARC-006\nDriverCommandPolicy" as A006
participant "ARC-005\nLockStateStore" as A005
participant "ARC-103\nActuatorOutputTestAdapter" as A103
participant "ARC-104\nDisplayOutputTestAdapter" as A104

note over A004
  이번 평가주기에 Driver_Command(side=right, action=lock)가
  staged 되어 있다고 가정 (SWR-020(b) 검증 목적)
end note

A102 -> A001 : IF-INT-002 submit_vehicle_snapshot(ignition_on=FALSE, t)
A001 -> A002 : IF-INT-009 evaluate(snapshot)

A002 -> A007 : IF-INT-008 evaluate(context)\n(category=OVERRIDE, asil=QM, priority=1)
A007 -> A005 : IF-INT-007 read_current()
A005 --> A007 : {left:LOCK, right:RELEASE} (직전 상태)
A007 --> A002 : PolicyResult(decision=OVERRIDE_FINAL,\nleft=RELEASE, right=RELEASE,\nstate=OFF, reason_code=IGNITION_OFF)

note over A002
  OVERRIDE_FINAL 수신 → 즉시 채택.
  ARC-006(BASE, SWR-004)과 staged된
  Driver_Command(side=right, action=lock)는
  평가되지 않고 건너뜀(SWR-020b: "새
  Driver_Command를 적용하지 않는다").
end note

A002 -> A004 : IF-INT-006 discard_current_cycle_command()\n(적용되지 않았음을 명시적으로 폐기)
A002 -> A005 : IF-INT-007 write(left=RELEASE, right=RELEASE)
A002 -> A103 : IF-INT-003 apply(left=RELEASE, right=RELEASE)
A002 -> A104 : IF-INT-004 show(state=OFF, reason_code=IGNITION_OFF)
A002 --> A001 : EvaluationResult

note over A007
  Phase 2에서 CrashOverridePolicy(ASIL B)가
  IF-INT-008에 category=OVERRIDE, asil=ASIL_B,
  priority=1로 등록되면, ARC-002는 CrashOverride를
  ARC-007(QM)보다 먼저 평가한다(ASIL 내림차순).
  ARC-007과 그 이하 컴포넌트는 코드 변경이 필요 없다.
end note
@enduml
